  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T14:05:25.865364Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T23:35:58.686423Z",
  "totalBlocks": 34,
  "translatedBlocks": 32,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ec80eb1b42714bf",
      "translationZh": "我一直在开发 mova——推理前的上下文主权：由你决定哪些上下文可以传给 AI，而 mova 会留下这一决策的证据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f49e8344fa263116",
      "translationZh": "它是一个开源的 Go 二进制程序，在调用 LLM 之前运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5ca9d3959a93e97",
      "translationZh": "Focus (AST) → PII 掩码处理 → token 预算 → 出站关卡（dry-run） → LLM → 证据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e6b0f16044240a3",
      "translationZh": "它不使用 LLM 来估算或审计上下文，治理步骤不需要 API 密钥，而且它不是网关，也不是 RAG 工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d49e57aaa8e6bc51",
      "translationZh": "我为什么发布这篇帖子",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b75776fa650b10b",
      "translationZh": "在使用编程智能体时，我反复遇到两件事：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32e31b098a1eb903",
      "translationZh": "只有代码仓库的一小部分与任务相关，却发送了大量上下文；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c90a968c804d3e0",
      "translationZh": "没有清晰的方法可以确切查看，在推理之前，哪些上下文被选中、过滤或阻止发送。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4d298b76aded30f",
      "translationZh": "我想弄清楚，这究竟是其他开发者真正关心的问题，还是仅仅是我自己恰好在意的事情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e6cd903b59ec03a",
      "translationZh": "一个可复现的示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35f4333f8b02cc92",
      "translationZh": "该仓库包含虚构数据和一个 Linux amd64 构建版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "285bbb3da611c22c",
      "translationZh": "治理前：20,014 个 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a4aa7f245e62e82",
      "translationZh": "治理后：7,153 个 token（−64%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f46a9ce3f64edaa7",
      "translationZh": "仅使用 AST 聚焦：20,101 → 5,325 个 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8749f46e22c363a1",
      "translationZh": "1,694 个候选 PII token 中有 171 个经过了假名化处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57de81f468955c32",
      "translationZh": "一个较小的虚构代码仓库：1,965 → 779 个 token（−60%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e0181395b9a981e",
      "translationZh": "该工具显示的成本数字是根据输入 token 估算出的理论值，并非实际的 API 支出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d18ca0675a7052d",
      "translationZh": "上下文控制适用于经由 mova（CLI/chat/MCP/HTTP）传递的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1de7d9ba6b2fda2c",
      "translationZh": "PII 遮蔽采用启发式方法；我尚未测量其精确率/召回率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c0bde8a2750ea4e",
      "translationZh": "mova 无法看到 IDE 在其控制范围之外直接发送的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17c70545fdc6bc2b",
      "translationZh": "macOS/Windows/arm64 构建产物是交叉编译的，但我尚未在这些目标机器上验证过。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2afd668c95061ebd",
      "translationZh": "我真正想了解的是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d132b040cf1239b7",
      "translationZh": "在使用编程智能体时，控制或审计上下文对你来说是一个切实存在的问题吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adf17fa5ae69e932",
      "translationZh": "你目前如何控制你的智能体发送给 LLM 的内容？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30f1dc7c676521f7",
      "translationZh": "对于同一项任务，你会有意减少发送的上下文吗？你会优先过滤或检查哪些内容？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13c5c954e4e4a47f",
      "translationZh": "你是否在意有证据能证明模型实际收到了什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d64d4ae0e88c0302",
      "translationZh": "如果你看到这样一个工具，你会使用它、忽略它，还是认为它没有必要？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fb83bda93be3d19",
      "translationZh": "如果你想了解更多细节，代码仓库中包含实现和可复现的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6604a96148e6e516",
      "translationZh": "欢迎直言不讳的反馈，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c775e660a49e6b",
      "translationZh": "“这解决了一个我并没有遇到的问题。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9620989f0fbff2c",
      "translationZh": "这对我来说确实是有用的反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab5d469eee13ea7b",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/1982_miguel 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "context sovereignty",
      "briefZh": "上下文主权",
      "explanationZh": "指由用户掌控哪些上下文可以传给 AI，并保留相关决策的证据。"
    },
    {
      "term": "inference",
      "briefZh": "推理",
      "explanationZh": "指模型根据输入执行计算并生成输出的过程。"
    },
    {
      "term": "AST",
      "briefZh": "抽象语法树",
      "explanationZh": "以树状结构表示源代码的语法，便于分析和选取相关代码。"
    },
    {
      "term": "PII masking",
      "briefZh": "个人信息掩码",
      "explanationZh": "对可识别个人身份的信息进行遮蔽处理，避免直接传出原始信息。"
    },
    {
      "term": "token budget",
      "briefZh": "词元预算",
      "explanationZh": "为传给模型的上下文设定词元数量额度。"
    },
    {
      "term": "egress gate",
      "briefZh": "出站关卡",
      "explanationZh": "在上下文发送到外部模型之前，检查并决定是否允许其传出的控制环节。"
    },
    {
      "term": "dry-run",
      "briefZh": "试运行",
      "explanationZh": "模拟执行检查流程，而不实际执行对应的发送操作。"
    },
    {
      "term": "coding agents",
      "briefZh": "编程智能体",
      "explanationZh": "能够围绕编程任务使用代码上下文并执行相关操作的 AI 智能体。"
    },
    {
      "term": "reproducible example",
      "briefZh": "可复现示例",
      "explanationZh": "其他人可以按相同步骤运行并验证结果的示例。"
    },
    {
      "term": "amd64",
      "briefZh": "处理器架构",
      "explanationZh": "指 x86 的 64 位架构，此处表示构建版本的目标架构。"
    },
    {
      "term": "tokens",
      "briefZh": "词元",
      "explanationZh": "模型处理文本时使用的基本单位，此处用于衡量治理前后的文本量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "PII-candidate tokens",
      "briefZh": "候选个人信息词元",
      "explanationZh": "被识别为可能包含个人身份信息的 token。"
    },
    {
      "term": "pseudonymized",
      "briefZh": "已假名化",
      "explanationZh": "将可识别身份的信息替换为假名或替代标识，以减少身份暴露。"
    },
    {
      "term": "input-token estimates",
      "briefZh": "输入词元估算",
      "explanationZh": "根据输入 token 数量估算出的数值，这里用于理论成本计算，而非实际 API 支出。"
    },
    {
      "term": "context control",
      "briefZh": "上下文控制",
      "explanationZh": "对传递给智能体的上下文进行管理；这里仅适用于经由 mova 传递的内容。"
    },
    {
      "term": "heuristic",
      "briefZh": "启发式",
      "explanationZh": "依靠经验规则或模式进行判断的方法，不保证完全准确。"
    },
    {
      "term": "precision/recall",
      "briefZh": "精确率/召回率",
      "explanationZh": "精确率衡量识别结果中正确结果的比例，召回率衡量应识别的内容中实际被识别出的比例。"
    },
    {
      "term": "cross-compiled",
      "briefZh": "交叉编译",
      "explanationZh": "在一种平台上编译生成供另一种目标平台运行的程序。"
    },
    {
      "term": "agent",
      "briefZh": "智能体",
      "explanationZh": "此处指执行任务并向大语言模型发送信息的 AI 系统。"
    },
    {
      "term": "LLM",
      "briefZh": "大语言模型",
      "explanationZh": "大型语言模型的英文缩写，此处是智能体发送内容的接收方。"
    },
    {
      "term": "context",
      "briefZh": "上下文",
      "explanationZh": "提供给模型、用于理解和完成当前任务的信息。"
    },
    {
      "term": "repository",
      "briefZh": "代码仓库",
      "explanationZh": "存放项目实现及相关示例的地方。"
    },
    {
      "term": "reproducible examples",
      "briefZh": "可复现示例",
      "explanationZh": "他人能够按相同方法运行并重现结果的示例。"
    },
    {
      "term": "feedback",
      "briefZh": "反馈",
      "explanationZh": "指对方提供的意见或回应，此处说这些反馈对作者有帮助。"
    }
  ],
